f20f&oh=00_Af-VoYdC-X-n9whBfF9uzzhpzM8ehFhn8wkRU3ptUqiMtg&oe=6A3EA072"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover.png", "id": "997322675508817", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974685_997322685508816_924110274691852915_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gbcra9VIBcAQ7kNvwFKExOo&_nc_oc=AdpmP6UafCpsvVTJJd2R9jARJCAJQ8mKbcosrtm6mEuWEkEYdi3SjIBs6StyIP9oZ18&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9PysR8kqGv1wu3isCEJQ-TS5l9aNruTNzHr0Mi3AeYew&oe=6A3E8C60"}, "display_name": "Blade and Bullet", "keywords": [], "long_description": "In the heart of a neon-lit metropolis, where the lines between the ancient and the futuristic blur, chaos reigns. The city of Neo-Shinobi is under siege by powerful criminal syndicates and rogue AI. As the last surviving member of an ancient ninja clan, you are thrust into a battle for survival and justice. Armed with a katana and a high-tech gun, your mission in \"Blade and Bullet\" is to defend the city from relentless assaults and restore peace to Neo-Shinobi.\nKey Features\n\n1. Immersive VR Experience\n\n    Dive into the neon-drenched streets of Neo-Shinobi with stunning VR visuals. The high-fidelity graphics and realistic soundscapes create an unparalleled sense of immersion, making you feel as if you are truly in the midst of a cyberpunk dystopia.", "short_description": "Storyline\n\nIn the heart of a neon-lit metropolis, where the lines between the ancient and the futuristic blur, chaos reigns. The city of Neo-Shinobi is under siege by powerful criminal syndicates and rogue AI. As the last surviving member of an ancient ninja clan, you are thrust into a battle for survival and justice. Armed with a katana and a high-tech gun, your mission in \"Blade and Bullet\" is to defend the city from relentless assaults and restore peace to Neo-Shinobi.\nKey Features\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.co